1
00:00:02,080 --> 00:00:05,200
Welcome, beautiful people, to Calm Depths.

2
00:00:05,240 --> 00:00:07,010
We’re so glad you’re here.

3
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:08,780
For the next little while,

4
00:00:08,820 --> 00:00:11,040
let the sounds around you carry you away

5
00:00:11,080 --> 00:00:13,730
from the noise of everyday life.

6
00:00:14,020 --> 00:00:15,760
Let your mind slow down,

7
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:18,530
your body relax, and your thoughts settle.

8
00:00:18,960 --> 00:00:22,040
Whether you’re here to rest, focus, meditate,

9
00:00:22,080 --> 00:00:24,100
or simply feel refreshed,

10
00:00:24,140 --> 00:00:25,990
give yourself this moment.

11
00:00:26,420 --> 00:00:28,680
Take a slow, deep breath in…

12
00:00:28,720 --> 00:00:31,990
and gently breathe out.

13
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:33,980
Let go of the day,

14
00:00:34,020 --> 00:00:35,840
make room for a little peace,

15
00:00:35,880 --> 00:00:38,250
and allow yourself to simply be.

16
00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:41,200
Get comfortable, and enjoy the sounds.
